    },
    {
      "key": "tf957bb3e88d6c86e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">You can access a wide range of global instruments from one account.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">一 つのアカウントから幅広いグローバル商品にアクセスできます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfc6a0bf8de9eb590",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">You can access instruments not listed on UAE exchanges.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">UAE 取引所にリストされていない商品にもアクセスできます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t21bfbccba8548471",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">You rely on the provider to handle your trade correctly and meet its obligations. If the provider is unregulated or poorly managed, your risk rises.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">お客様は、取引を正しく処理し、その義務を履行するためにプロバイダーを信頼しています。プロバイダーが規制されていなかったり、管理が不十分だったりすると、リスクが高まります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdbd94ae8842739d4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage can magnify both profits and losses. A small move in the market can have a much larger effect on your account than you expect.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">レバレッジを活用すると、利益と損失の両方が拡大する可能性があります。市場の小さな動きは、予想よりもはるかに大きな影響をアカウントに与える可能性があります。</span>"
    },
