      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ドバイでは店頭取引は合法ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te5f9509bc78a0e59",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What can you trade OTC?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">OTCでは何を取引できますか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t687a1c9483c2d326",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Yes, OTC trading carries market risk, leverage risk, counterparty risk, and regulatory risk. You should always trade with caution.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">はい、店頭取引には市場リスク、レバレッジリスク、取引相手リスク、規制リスクが伴います。常に注意して取引する必要があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tef9ed50ef765f776",
