      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Here’s why many traders prefer </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">CFD index</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"> trading</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">:</span>",
